        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_Fortunately, this was not the first time the Nagas had met their kind, and after a while they understood where the trolls were going.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_7",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_The old wose’s directions had been too complicated for Ougl to follow. He had forgotten most of them already. But with a guide, the trolls would surely reach their goal.</i>"),
