          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_The outside world was everything Ougl had imagined. Green. Full of sound and life. Ougl and the Golden Flame Tribe were filled with awe.</i>"),
