            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_A bright light shone overhead, brighter than anything Ougl had ever seen. The light hurt to look at. The light made everything hurt to look at, but Ougl kept looking anyway.</i>"),
          },
