          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_The saurian stole away Ougl’s inner flame and quenched it with magic. Bitter cold cut into Ougl’s stone-like body.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "MZ",
            text: _("<b>S y s s...</b> (You will follow us wherever we go if you want to regain your inner flame, troll.)"),
