            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_The trolls joined their new leaders, and learned from them. They learned to lust for the sheen of gold and the smell of blood. They learned to spread ruin and death.</i>"),
